    "Be human. Keep conversations consensual, avoid targeted abuse and threats, and report content that puts people at risk. Safety reports are reviewed by the Echo team and may be retained to protect the community.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Be human. Keep conversations consensual, avoid targeted abuse and threats, and report content that puts people at risk. Safety reports are reviewed by the Echo team and may be retained to protect the community."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sea humano. Mantenga las conversaciones consensuadas, evite abusos y amenazas dirigidas y denuncie contenido que ponga a las personas en riesgo. El equipo de Echo revisa los informes de seguridad y pueden conservarse para proteger a la comunidad."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seja humano. Mantenha as conversas consensuais, evite abusos e ameaças direcionadas e denuncie conteúdos que coloquem pessoas em risco. As denúncias de segurança são analisadas pela equipe do Echo e podem ser mantidas para proteger a comunidade."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sei menschlich. Halte Unterhaltungen einvernehmlich, vermeide gezielte Beleidigungen und Drohungen und melde Inhalte, die Menschen gefährden. Sicherheitsmeldungen werden vom Echo-Team geprüft und können zum Schutz der Community gespeichert werden."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
