    "Keep messages in step between this Echo channel and a Discord channel. Messages from Discord need the Echo bot online in that server. Messages from Echo to Discord are set up automatically when you turn on Echo → Discord.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep messages in step between this Echo channel and a Discord channel. Messages from Discord need the Echo bot online in that server. Messages from Echo to Discord are set up automatically when you turn on Echo → Discord."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén sincronizados los mensajes entre este canal de Echo y un canal de Discord. Para los mensajes de Discord, el bot de Echo debe estar en línea en ese servidor. Los mensajes de Echo a Discord se configuran automáticamente al activar Echo → Discord."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantenha as mensagens sincronizadas entre este canal do Echo e um canal do Discord. As mensagens do Discord exigem que o bot do Echo esteja online nesse servidor. As mensagens do Echo para o Discord são configuradas automaticamente quando você ativa Echo → Discord."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halte Nachrichten zwischen diesem Echo-Kanal und einem Discord-Kanal synchron. Für Nachrichten von Discord muss der Echo-Bot auf diesem Server online sein. Nachrichten von Echo zu Discord werden automatisch eingerichtet, wenn du Echo → Discord aktivierst."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
